993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Mar. Restaurante</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante de frutos do mar em São Bento, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Mirante do Mar, escondidinho de camarão e palmito, com base de mousseline de raízes, farofa de panko e parmesão, espuma aerada de catupiry, finalizada com crispy de filo.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-29\" data-position=\"29\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Cozí+ Cafeteria e restaurante</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Felicidade na Panela, camarão e lula ao curry suave, com arroz cremoso ao leite de coco, finalizado com camarão crocante.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-30\" data-position=\"30\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tug