 cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>La Pastaria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante italiano no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Gnochi Nuvem Coral, gnochi da Nona, ao molho branco com bisque de camarão e alho-poró, finalizado com camarão flambado ao rum, farofa de bacon e tuile coral.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-32\" data-position=\"32\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Tróia Bar Lounge</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Bar em São Bento, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Memórias entre duas mordidas, pão de hambúrguer e blend de carne 150g, gorgonzola, geléia de bacon, rúcula e cebola crispy.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-33\" data-position=\"33\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Lino Cafeteria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cafeteria no Boulevard Canal, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Três Pausas, tortinha de Laranja recheada com creme e compota artesanal de laranja. Tortinha Floresta Negra com mousse de chocolate e cereja, geléia de frutas vermelhas e cereja marraschino. Tortinha de Caramelo salgado com recheio de caramelo e flor de sal. Todas finalizadas com marshmallow.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-34\" data-position=\"34\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Restaurante Picolino</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante de cozinha brasileira no Boulevard Canal, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Legado, nhoque de batata com camarões ao molho à la Mourisco, creme de leite fresco, mostarda e damasco, finalizado com amêndoas laminadas.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-35\" data-position=\"35\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Quasar Sorveteria Artesanal</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Gelateria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Abraço de Vó, torta de Maçã com toque de canela, acompanhado com sorvete de creme e finalizada com caramelo salgado.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-36\" data-position=\"36\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Pão do Edu — Centro</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Padaria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Uai Dog, sanduiche de linguiça mineira artesanal com creme de queijo meia cura, rúcula, pesto de ora-pro-nobis, no pão brioche de bacon, queijo e ervas.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-37\" data-position=\"37\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Nevada Doçaria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Confeitaria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Bella Sicilia, tortinha individual de brigadeiro de limão siciliano com geléia de amora envolta de nozes pecã triturados.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-38\" data-position=\"38\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Armazém do Portuga</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Bacalhau a Brás, lascas de Bacalhau refogado no azeite, cebola, alho e azeitona, com ovos caipira mexidos, finalizado com batata palha e salsinha.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-39\" data-position=\"39\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Brigaderia da Vovó</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Doceria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Doce lembrança, bolo úmido de chocolate e amêndoas com calda de creme inglês.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-40\" data-position=\"40\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Sabor e Arte Restaurante</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante de cozinha brasileira no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Abraço de Domingo, pappardelle artesanal ao molho cremoso de curry, lascas de sobrecoxa e cubos de manga.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-41\" data-position=\"41\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Constantino Hamburgueria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Hamburgueria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Quinto Quarto, sanduíche de rabada ao demi-glace, pesto de agrião, nosso brazilian cheese, pão de fermentação selvagem e palha de mandioca.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-42\" data-position=\"42\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Cafeteria Encontros</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cafeteria no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Sanduíche de Pernil da Vó Necy, sanduíche de pão ciabatta com pernil suíno desfiado, queijo muçarela, rúcula fresca, fatias de tomate seco e vinagrete de abacaxi.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-43\" data-position=\"43\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Bom Apetite</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante de cozinha brasileira na Praia do Forte, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Peixe Cremoso, peixe do dia (pescada amarela, namorado ou cherne), ao molho branco, gratinado no forno com batatas.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-44\" data-position=\"44\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Nova Onda Hotel</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Hotel no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Rolé do Nova Onda, bife rolé de filé mignon ao molho ferrugem, acompanhado de nhoque artesanal com molho da casa, finalizado com bacon crocante e parmesão.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-45\" data-position=\"45\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Restaurante Farol do Forte</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Centro, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Cinquenta Anos de Praia, arroz cozido no vapor, camarões salteados, molho de camarão com catupiry e muçarela, cebola roxa suavizada, salsa fresca, finalizado com queijo parmesão e cebola crispy.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-46\" data-position=\"46\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Mará Cozinha Memorável</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante de frutos do mar na Praia do Forte, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Camarão ao pôr do sol, rigatone com Creme de Abóbora e Catupiry, camarão grelhado com flocos de queijo azul.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-47\" data-position=\"47\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Cookiz &amp; Coffee</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cafeteria no Jardim Flamboyant, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Memória Feliz, croissant recheado de Blent suíno, creme de queijo e abacaxi temperado, acompanhado de cookie red velvet, recheado com doce de leite da casa, finalizado com caramelo salgado e pudim de pão.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-48\" data-position=\"48\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Sem Frescura Burger</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Hamburgueria no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato De volta para casa, pão brioche com maionese trufada, carne 150g, queijo minas padrão, geléia de goiaba artesanal e batata palha.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-49\" data-position=\"49\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Mesona</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Sabor de Domingo, creme de milho feito na casa, costela bovina envolta em um dry rub super especial e assada lentamente e finalizado com picles de cebola roxa e farofa de brioche.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-50\" data-position=\"50\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Andressa Aguiar Confeitaria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Confeitaria no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Torta de Avelã Crocante, massa sablée de avelã, recheada de brigadeiro intenso de cacau 50%, finalizada com crocante de pailleté feuilletine e creme de avelã.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-51\" data-position=\"51\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">51</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Office Café</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cafeteria no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Dorama Ice, stecco de Gelato Fior di Latte, envolto em chocolate meio amargo, coberto com marshmallow maçaricado, decorado com Creme de avelã e creme de pistache, com castanhas crocantes.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-52\" data-position=\"52\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Restaurante Pelicano Oásis</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Memórias Oásis, risoto cremoso de 2 queijos, provolone e parmesão, acompanhado de fraldinha desfiada ao molho da carne, finalizado com tuile de parmesão.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-53\" data-position=\"53\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Zion Bike Café</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cafeteria no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Doce Mala, cheesecake de pé de moleque, com base crocante e recheio de cream cheese com cobertura de doce de leite caseiro.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-54\" data-position=\"54\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Bistrô Milano</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Bistrô no Braga, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Bão Demais, baguete de pão de queijo recheada com pernil suíno, cebola caramelizada e goiabada levemente picante.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-55\" data-position=\"55\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Mangia Que Cresce Pizzaria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Pizzaria no Jardim Caiçara, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Mangia Dog, dogão artesanal com linguiça suína, pão de massa de pizza de longa fermentação, molho de tomate artesanal, creme de burrata, vinagrete de cebola roxa, tomate e jalapeño.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-56\" data-position=\"56\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Ancho e Faca</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Churrascaria no Jardim Excelsior, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Involtinis di Pollo e Bechamel de Milho, involtinis de sobrecoxa de frango desossada recheados com provolone defumado, presunto, pimentão vermelho assado na brasa, acompanhados de bechamel de milho, cebolinha, alecrim e bastão de milho assado.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-57\" data-position=\"57\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Família Braga Gourmet</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Pizzaria no Jardim Excelsior, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Pão Rústico do Mar, pão rústico recheado com fondue de 3 queijos e camarão marinado e cheiro verde fresco com crosta maçaricada.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-58\" data-position=\"58\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Família Braga Pizzaria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Pizzaria no Jardim Excelsior, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Pizza Mare &amp; Crean, pizza tradicional com molho de tomate da casa, muçarela, salmão, cream cheese, mix de gergelim, cebolinha e teriyaki.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-59\" data-position=\"59\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Hey Crepe</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Doceria no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Crepe da Vó Fausta, crepe de massa fina recheada com costela bovina desfiada, catupiry, abacaxi in natura e molho barbecue.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-60\" data-position=\"60\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Boteco Seu Osmar</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Bar no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato A fraldinha que cheira a infância, fraldinha defumada desfiada, com aligot de aipim finalizado com molho agridoce.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-61\" data-position=\"61\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Japa do Seu Osmar</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Bar no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Hot do Seu Osmar, hot roll empanado recheado com salmão e cream cheese, envolto em arroz e alga nori, com casquinha crocante e molho especial no push pop.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-62\" data-position=\"62\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Limoeiro Bar e Quitutes</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Bar no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Abraço de Domingo, croquete de carne de panela e especiarias, acompanhado de molho da casa.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-63\" data-position=\"63\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Faella Bistrô</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Sabores da Memória, talharim ao creme de alho-poró e limão siciliano, lascas de salmão finalizado com camarões em crosta de pistache.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-64\" data-position=\"64\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Tucas Empório Bistrô</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Vulcão Sertanejo, bolinho de risoto de pernil com parmesao, recheado com pernil cozido lentamente na cerveja e catupiry! Empanado na panco na cama de parmesão e geleia de rapadura picante.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-65\" data-position=\"65\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Pizza 55</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Pizzaria no Parque Burle, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato A Lenda Marins, pizza com massa de beterraba de longa fermentação, molho da casa, muçarela, ricota, queijo parmesão, cream cheese e bacon de pernil, finalizada com creme de goiaba e orégano.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-66\" data-position=\"66\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Nina Pasta e Basta</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante italiano no Portinho, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Rigatone All’Amatriciana, massa seca italiana, rigatone, molho de tomate da casa, cebola roxa, pimenta calabresa a gosto e guanciale. Finalizado com parmesão ralado.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-67\" data-position=\"67\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Garota Beer</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Pub no Palmeiras, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Boeuf Bourguignon, carne bovina cozida por 4 horas no vinho, bacon, cenoura e cogumelos, acompanha polenta cremosa e cebola crispy.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-68\" data-position=\"68\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">68</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Paelo Hamburgueria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Hamburgueria no Portinho, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Velho Smoke, cheeseburguer defumado com aioli de picles e cebola roxa, servido de demi glace de carne, acompanhado de batata crisscut.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-69\" data-position=\"69\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">69</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Showrrasquinho Gourmet</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Portinho, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Brasa e Raízes, cupim casquerado, 8 horas de fogo, com aipim artesanal coberto com parmesão maçaricado, acompanhado de molho à campanha, farofa de cebola e molho chimichurri da casa.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-70\" data-position=\"70\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">70</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Gunther Hamburgueria</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Hamburgueria no Parque Burle, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Fritz, pão pretzel artesanal, burguer 180g, chucrute, carne suína desfiada, purê rústico de batata, molho à base de ketchup, curry e especiarias.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-71\" data-position=\"71\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">71</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Bazar Bakery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Padaria no Portinho, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Encontro da Tarde, pão de milho artesanal, molho especial de camarão, alho poró, cream cheese, alfafa e rúcula, burrata de búfala, queijo parmesão, molho pesto, presunto royale, finalizado com azeite.</p></div></li><li id=\"stop-72\" data-position=\"72\" class=\"ml-8 scroll-mt-28 mb-10\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[15px] flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-full text-xs font-black ring-4 ring-white transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none bg-tuggi-primary text-tuggi-dark \" aria-hidden=\"true\">72</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-tuggi-bg p-5 shadow-sm transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-gray-100\"><h3 class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-lg font-bold text-tuggi-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-tuggi-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Âncora Restaurante</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Restaurante no Peró, em Cabo Frio. Leva ao Festival Sabores de Cabo Frio 2026 o prato Raízes da Memória, picanha grelhada com mousseline de baroa, farofa crocante de panko e bacon na manteiga, finalizada com pesto de manjericão.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-tuggi-bg\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"faq-heading\" class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-8\">Perguntas frequentes</h2><div class=\"space-y-3 max-w-3xl\"><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Quanto tempo dura este roteiro?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Cerca de 1h 55min de áudio em 72 paradas, cobrindo aproximadamente 55,4 km. No seu ritmo — o áudio toca automaticamente enquanto você se desloca.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Em quais idiomas está disponível?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Este roteiro está disponível em: Português.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Preciso de conexão com a internet?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Não. Baixe o roteiro no app Tuggi e ouça offline — o áudio é ativado pela sua localização, sem precisar usar as mãos.</p></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-5\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none font-bold text-tuggi-dark\">Dá para fazer a pé ou de carro?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-tuggi-primary transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-tuggi-slate leading-relaxed\">Esta rota foi pensada para um trajeto Fácil. O áudio se adapta ao seu ritmo.</p></details></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><div class=\"page-shell\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"text-3xl font-black text-tuggi-dark mb-8\">Mais roteiros por perto</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all focus:outline-none focus